{%- comment -%}
  YMAL — card-only product template.

  Fetched by the Recently Viewed script as /products/<handle>?view=ymal-card.
  Returns one card and nothing else: no layout, no header, no footer.

  Deliberately thin. The gate and the markup live in snippets/ymal-card.liquid
  so that the server-rendered blocks and this client-fetched one cannot drift
  apart - there is one rule, in one file, and this is only a way to reach it
  over HTTP.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% layout none %}
{%- render 'ymal-card', product: product -%}
